[gd_resource type="Animation" format=3]

; The 3D balloon's inflate (CHANGE-BRIEF.md, revision of 21 Nov 2026, "the balloon task is 'Let
; the balloons go'"; not graded): the girl blows it up, from a small, limp bud by the knot to
; full size at its place on its string, over 3.0 s (72 frames at 24 fps), step 1/24 s,
; LOOP_NONE. On the balloon's Float node (its body and string; the balloon's own node never
; moves): scale from a flat 0.14 x 0.07 to 1, swelling faster as it fills and settling;
; position from 0.5 m down its string (near the knot) up to its place. Cubic. Played once by the
; balloon's own script (props/party_balloon.gd), which then plays `bob`. The game times the
; blowing up itself (camp_balloons.gd INFLATE, the same 3.0 s), never from this clip.
; The paths are relative to the AnimationPlayer's root_node (the Balloon, in
; props/party_balloon.tscn).

